<title>SPAIN: Dragados wins one bln peseta Moroccan contract.</title>
<headline>Dragados wins one bln peseta Moroccan contract.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish construction building Dragados Maroc won a one billion peseta ($6.9 million) contract in Morocco to construct a factory, a statement said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dragados Maroc is a unit of the Spanish joint venture Dragados FCC international de Construccion, a joint venture carried by Dragados and Fomento de Construcciones y Contratas (FCC).</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340 ($ = 145.9 Spanish Pesetas)</p>
</text>
